<title>USA: St Louis feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Louis feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>EAST ST LOUIS, Ill. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Receipts- 250 Last week- 250  Last Year-No report.</p>
<p>FEEDER CATTLE AUCTION:  250 head. Compared with last week, light supply feeder steers and heifers steady. Overall quality below normal. Moderate buyer attendance.</p>
<p>FEEDER STEERS: Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>Thin: 400-500 lbs. 80.00-86.00, Crossbreds 86.00-89.00</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 77.00-84.00</p>
<p>600-700 lbs. 72.00-78.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy:  400-700 lbs. 70.00-80.00</p>
<p>700-900 lbs. 65.00-72.00</p>
<p>LARGE FRAME 2 HOLSTEINS: 600-1050 lbs. 51.00-56.00</p>
<p>FEEDER HEIFERS:  Medium and Large Frame 1:</p>
<p>Thin: 400-500 lbs. 73.00-78.00, Package Crossbreds 84.00</p>
<p>500-600 lbs. 70.00-76.00, Crossbreds 76.00-79.00</p>
<p>Moderately Fleshy: 400-600 lbs. 65.00-73.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
